{"about_the_game":"Tales of War is a highly dynamic multiplayer voxel medieval experience featuring large scale castle siege maps and many classes to choose from.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20+ classes</li></ul></strong> 5 classes of each role: Frontline, Ranged, Support and Mobile.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/1d42484bef6d2e3f04f0c0eaa43f1585.poster.avif?t=1769437551\" width=616 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/1d42484bef6d2e3f04f0c0eaa43f1585.webm?t=1769437551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/1d42484bef6d2e3f04f0c0eaa43f1585.mp4?t=1769437551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Siege [2-100 players]</li></ul></strong> Engage in large-scale battles and conquer all flags to win.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/7a9fa708a33483ec670e478526427441.poster.avif?t=1769437551\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/7a9fa708a33483ec670e478526427441.webm?t=1769437551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arena[1vs1 2vs2 3vs3]</li></ul></strong> Fight in close quarters and defeat each enemy 3 times to win. An Arena server contains 4 arenas (up to 24 players) and 12+ randomly selected map<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/f0bb8186d6908ef6da01f9e92fca90c1.avif?t=1769437551\" width=616